### CampusQuest Progress Tracking Tests

### 1. Get Overall Progress (Questions attempted, correct, accuracy, streak, etc.)
GET http://localhost:5000/progress
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_STUDENT_TOKEN_HERE

### 2. Get Subject-wise Performance Breakdown
GET http://localhost:5000/progress/subjects
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_STUDENT_TOKEN_HERE

### 3. Get Weak Areas & Recommendations
GET http://localhost:5000/progress/weak-areas
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_STUDENT_TOKEN_HERE
